        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">WelcomeBC: BC PNP news (April 23, 2026 priorities and program updates)</a></li>
